# Project conventions

- Minimize scope: only change code required for the task.
- Match existing Java/Spring style in this repo (package `com.systemdesign.feed`).
- Prefer editing existing classes over adding new abstractions for one-off needs.
- Do not add markdown docs unless the user asks.
- Do not commit unless explicitly requested.
- Use `mvn` for build/test; use `docker compose` for local Postgres/Kafka.
